---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Shopify Dev Handbook"
  description="Learn Shopify app and extension development from the ground up — the curriculum, the hands-on build, the extension surfaces, and what's actually changed recently."
  accent="gold"
>
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>Shopify Dev Handbook</h1>
    <p class="lede">Learn Shopify app and extension development from the ground up — the curriculum, the hands-on build, the extension surfaces, and what's actually changed recently — in one place.</p>
    <p class="free-note">Every tool, account, and resource linked across this site has a genuine free tier.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="stackstrip">
    <span class="chip">Template: <b>React Router 7</b></span>
    <span class="chip">Admin API: <b>GraphQL only</b></span>
    <span class="chip">UI: <b>Polaris</b></span>
    <span class="chip">DB: <b>Prisma</b></span>
    <span class="chip">Checkout: <b>UI Extensions + Functions</b></span>
    <span class="chip">See full details on the <a href="/changelog" class="changelog-link">Changelog →</a></span>
  </div>

  <div class="grid">
    <a class="pagecard card-roadmap" href="/roadmap">
      <div class="eyebrow">Curriculum</div>
      <h2>Learning Roadmap</h2>
      <p>The structured, module-by-module curriculum: React → TypeScript → GraphQL → the app template → auth → Prisma → webhooks/billing → shipping, plus a full backend-fundamentals track and a toolchain/config-literacy track (package.json, tsconfig, JSDoc, build tools, debugging).</p>
      <div class="go">Start learning →</div>
    </a>

    <a class="pagecard card-start" href="/getting-started">
      <div class="eyebrow">Hands-on tutorial</div>
      <h2>Your First App</h2>
      <p>One straight walkthrough: <code>shopify app init</code>, a guided tour of every generated file, building a small real feature end to end, and deploying it for free.</p>
      <div class="go">Build something →</div>
    </a>

    <a class="pagecard card-ext" href="/extensions">
      <div class="eyebrow">Deep dive</div>
      <h2>App Extensions</h2>
      <p>Theme app extensions, Admin UI extensions, checkout &amp; customer account UI extensions, and Shopify Functions — what each is for, how they're built, tested, and shipped.</p>
      <div class="go">Explore extensions →</div>
    </a>

    <a class="pagecard card-changelog" href="/changelog">
      <div class="eyebrow">Stay current</div>
      <h2>Changelog</h2>
      <p>Shopify changes its recommended stack often. This page tracks only the changes that are necessary to know or genuinely major — checked automatically on a weekly schedule.</p>
      <div class="go">See what's new →</div>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="path">
    <h2>Suggested path</h2>
    <ol>
      <li><b>New to React/TypeScript/GraphQL?</b> Start with the <a href="/roadmap">Roadmap</a>'s Shopify track — do the fundamentals in order, or jump into a <a href="/crash-courses">Crash Course</a> for the one you need right now.</li>
      <li><b>Already comfortable with the fundamentals, want to build something now?</b> Jump straight to <a href="/getting-started">Your First App</a> and come back to the Roadmap for whatever feels shaky.</li>
      <li><b>Main app working?</b> Move on to <a href="/extensions">Extensions</a> to reach the storefront, checkout, and Admin's own surfaces.</li>
      <li><b>Anytime.</b> Skim the <a href="/changelog">Changelog</a> before starting a new feature — Shopify's recommended stack shifts more often than most platforms.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <footer class="sitefooter">
    Everywhere on this site, "read more" points back to <a href="https://shopify.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener">shopify.dev</a> — Shopify's own docs are always the tiebreaker when something here and the live docs disagree.
  </footer>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero h1 {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 6vw, 3.2rem); margin: 0 0 18px; letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }
  .hero .lede { font-size: var(--fs-lede); max-width: 46ch; }
  .hero .free-note {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--green); margin: 0 0 52px;
  }

  .stackstrip { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 56px; }
  .stackstrip .chip {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.85rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 20px; padding: 7px 15px; color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .stackstrip .chip b { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
  .changelog-link { color: var(--orange); }

  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 56px; }
  .pagecard {
    display: block; text-decoration: none; background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; padding: 28px 28px 26px;
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease; box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .pagecard:hover { border-color: var(--accent-local); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .pagecard .eyebrow {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .pagecard h2 { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.35rem; margin: 0 0 12px; color: var(--text); }
  .pagecard p { font-size: var(--fs-small); color: var(--text-dim); margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .pagecard .go { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; }

  .card-roadmap { --accent-local: var(--gold); }
  .card-roadmap .eyebrow, .card-roadmap .go { color: var(--gold); }
  .card-start { --accent-local: var(--blue); }
  .card-start .eyebrow, .card-start .go { color: var(--blue); }
  .card-ext { --accent-local: var(--green); }
  .card-ext .eyebrow, .card-ext .go { color: var(--green); }
  .card-changelog { --accent-local: var(--orange); }
  .card-changelog .eyebrow, .card-changelog .go { color: var(--orange); }

  .path {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 14px; padding: 30px 32px; margin-bottom: 48px; box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .path h2 { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 0 0 20px; color: var(--gold); }
  .path ol { margin: 0; padding-left: 22px; font-size: var(--fs-body); }
  .path li { margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .path a { color: var(--text); text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--line); }
  .path a:hover { text-decoration-color: var(--text); }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
